# PHP Standards (WordPress)

## WordPress Coding Standards

Follow the official [WordPress PHP Coding Standards](https://developer.wordpress.org/coding-standards/wordpress-coding-standards/php/).

## Theme Prefix & Text Domain

```php
// Function prefix: skel_
// Text domain: 'skel'

// ✅ Correct
function skel_enqueue_scripts() { }
__( 'Text', 'skel' );
esc_html_e( 'Skip to content', 'skel' );

// ❌ Wrong
function skeleton_enqueue_scripts() { }
__( 'Text', 'skeleton' );
```

## Naming Conventions

### Functions
```php
// ✅ Correct - Lowercase with underscores, prefixed with skel_
function skel_get_custom_logo() { }
function skel_register_sidebars() { }
function skel_enqueue_scripts() { }
function skel_setup_theme() { }

// ❌ Wrong - camelCase or wrong prefix
function getCustomLogo() { }
function skeleton_register_sidebars() { }
```

### Classes
```php
// ✅ Correct - Capitalized words with underscores, prefixed
class Skel_Custom_Walker extends Walker_Nav_Menu { }
class Skel_Theme_Setup { }

// ❌ Wrong
class customWalker { }
class ThemeSetup { }
```

### Constants
```php
// ✅ Correct - Uppercase with underscores
define( 'THEME_VERSION', '1.0.0' );
define( 'DEFAULT_THUMBNAIL_ID', 123 );

// ❌ Wrong
define( 'themeVersion', '1.0.0' );
```

### Variables
```php
// ✅ Correct - Lowercase with underscores
$post_id = get_the_ID();
$header_options = get_field( 'header', 'option' );
$custom_field = get_post_meta( $post_id, '_custom_field', true );

// ❌ Wrong - camelCase
$postId = get_the_ID();
$headerOptions = get_field( 'header', 'option' );
```

### Files
```php
// ✅ Correct - Lowercase with hyphens
template-parts/content-single.php
functions/enqueue-scripts.php
functions/register-nav-menus.php

// ❌ Wrong
templateParts/contentSingle.php
functions/enqueueScripts.php
```

## Spacing & Formatting

### Spaces Inside Parentheses
```php
// ✅ Correct - Spaces after opening and before closing
if ( $condition ) { }
foreach ( $items as $item ) { }
while ( have_posts() ) { }
function_call( $arg1, $arg2 );
array( 'key' => 'value' );

// ❌ Wrong - No spaces
if ($condition) { }
foreach ($items as $item) { }
function_call($arg1, $arg2);
```

### Spaces Around Operators
```php
// ✅ Correct
$result = $a + $b;
$is_valid = $value === true;
$full_name = $first_name . ' ' . $last_name;

// ❌ Wrong
$result=$a+$b;
$is_valid=$value===true;
```

### Array Syntax
```php
// ✅ Preferred - Short syntax with trailing comma
$array = [
	'key1' => 'value1',
	'key2' => 'value2',
	'key3' => 'value3',
];

// ✅ Also acceptable - Long syntax
$array = array(
	'key1' => 'value1',
	'key2' => 'value2',
);

// ❌ Wrong - No trailing comma, inconsistent spacing
$array = array('key1'=>'value1','key2'=>'value2');
```

### Indentation
```php
// ✅ Correct - Use TABS, not spaces
function skel_example() {
	$variable = 'value';

	if ( $condition ) {
		// Indented with tab
		do_something();
	}
}
```

### Braces
```php
// ✅ Correct - Opening brace on same line
if ( $condition ) {
	// code
} elseif ( $other_condition ) {
	// code
} else {
	// code
}

// ✅ Correct - Functions and classes
function skel_function_name() {
	// code
}

class Skel_Class_Name {
	// code
}
```

## Escaping Output

### ALWAYS Escape Output
```php
// Text content
echo esc_html( $text );
<?php echo esc_html( $variable ); ?>

// HTML attributes
<div class="<?php echo esc_attr( $class ); ?>">
<a href="<?php echo esc_url( $url ); ?>">
<img alt="<?php echo esc_attr( $image_alt ); ?>">

// JavaScript data
<script>var data = <?php echo wp_json_encode( $data ); ?>;</script>

// HTML content (allows safe HTML)
echo wp_kses_post( $html_content );

// Translation with escaping
echo esc_html__( 'Text to translate', 'skel' );
echo esc_attr__( 'Attribute text', 'skel' );
esc_html_e( 'Text to echo', 'skel' );
```

### Escaping Functions Reference
```php
esc_html()     // Escape for HTML text content
esc_attr()     // Escape for HTML attributes
esc_url()      // Escape URLs
esc_js()       // Escape for inline JavaScript
esc_textarea() // Escape for textarea content
wp_kses()      // Allow specific HTML tags
wp_kses_post() // Allow HTML tags valid in post content
```

## Sanitizing Input

### ALWAYS Sanitize Input
```php
// Text fields
$clean_text = sanitize_text_field( $_POST['field'] );

// Email
$clean_email = sanitize_email( $_POST['email'] );

// URL
$clean_url = esc_url_raw( $_POST['url'] );

// Integer
$clean_int = absint( $_GET['id'] );
$clean_int = intval( $_GET['id'] );

// Textarea
$clean_textarea = sanitize_textarea_field( $_POST['message'] );

// File name
$clean_filename = sanitize_file_name( $_FILES['file']['name'] );

// HTML content
$clean_html = wp_kses_post( $_POST['content'] );
```

## Nonces & Security

### Form Nonces
```php
// Create nonce field in form
wp_nonce_field( 'skel_action', 'skel_nonce' );

// Verify nonce on submission
if ( ! isset( $_POST['skel_nonce'] ) ||
     ! wp_verify_nonce( $_POST['skel_nonce'], 'skel_action' ) ) {
	wp_die( esc_html__( 'Security check failed.', 'skel' ) );
}
```

### AJAX Nonces
```php
// Create nonce for AJAX
$nonce = wp_create_nonce( 'skel_ajax_nonce' );

// Verify in AJAX handler
check_ajax_referer( 'skel_ajax_nonce', 'nonce' );
```

### Capability Checks
```php
// Check user capabilities
if ( ! current_user_can( 'edit_posts' ) ) {
	wp_die( esc_html__( 'You do not have permission.', 'skel' ) );
}
```

## Internationalization (i18n)

### Text Domain
```php
// Always use 'skel' as text domain
__( 'Text', 'skel' )
_e( 'Text', 'skel' )
esc_html__( 'Text', 'skel' )
esc_html_e( 'Text', 'skel' )
esc_attr__( 'Text', 'skel' )
esc_attr_e( 'Text', 'skel' )
```

### Translation Functions
```php
// Return translated string
$text = __( 'Hello World', 'skel' );

// Echo translated string
_e( 'Hello World', 'skel' );

// With escaping (preferred)
echo esc_html__( 'Hello World', 'skel' );
esc_html_e( 'Hello World', 'skel' );

// Placeholders
printf(
	/* translators: %s: User name */
	esc_html__( 'Hello, %s!', 'skel' ),
	esc_html( $user_name )
);

// Plural forms
printf(
	/* translators: %d: Number of items */
	esc_html( _n( '%d item', '%d items', $count, 'skel' ) ),
	$count
);
```

## Template Structure

### The Loop
```php
<?php if ( have_posts() ) : ?>
	<?php while ( have_posts() ) : the_post(); ?>
		<article <?php post_class(); ?>>
			<header class="entry-header">
				<?php the_title( '<h2 class="entry-title">', '</h2>' ); ?>
			</header>

			<div class="entry-content">
				<?php the_content(); ?>
			</div>
		</article>
	<?php endwhile; ?>

	<?php the_posts_pagination(); ?>

<?php else : ?>
	<p><?php esc_html_e( 'No posts found.', 'skel' ); ?></p>
<?php endif; ?>
```

### Template Parts
```php
// Load template part
get_template_part( 'template-parts/content', get_post_type() );

// With arguments (WordPress 5.5+)
get_template_part( 'template-parts/card', 'product', [
	'product_id' => $product_id,
	'show_price' => true,
] );

// In template part, access args
$product_id = $args['product_id'] ?? 0;
$show_price = $args['show_price'] ?? false;
```

### Header & Footer
```php
// header.php
<!doctype html>
<html <?php language_attributes(); ?>>
<head>
	<meta charset="<?php bloginfo( 'charset' ); ?>">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<?php wp_head(); ?>
</head>
<body <?php body_class( 'site-wrapper' ); ?>>
<?php wp_body_open(); ?>

// footer.php
<?php wp_footer(); ?>
</body>
</html>
```

## ACF Block Template Pattern

```php
<?php
/**
 * Block Name ACF Block
 *
 * @package Skeleton
 * @subpackage ACF
 */

// Set thumbnail preview in backend.
if ( isset( $block['data']['preview_image'] ) ) {
	echo '<img src="' . esc_url( $block['data']['preview_image'] ) . '" style="width:100%; height:auto;">';
	return;
}

// Return early if display is off.
$display = get_field( 'display' );
if ( 'on' !== $display ) {
	return;
}

// Data options
$items = get_field( 'items' );

if ( ! is_array( $items ) || empty( $items ) ) {
	return;
}

// Developer options
$spacing        = get_field( 'spacing' );
$spacing_top    = $spacing['top']['spacing_top'] ?? '';
$spacing_bottom = $spacing['bottom']['spacing_bottom'] ?? '';
$custom_classes = get_field( 'custom_classes' );
$custom_css     = get_field( 'custom_css' );
$unique_id      = get_field( 'unique_id' );

// Custom Spacing
$spacing_top_custom    = 'custom' === $spacing_top ? "--spacing-top-custom: {$spacing['top']['custom_value']};" : '';
$spacing_bottom_custom = 'custom' === $spacing_bottom ? "--spacing-bottom-custom: {$spacing['bottom']['custom_value']};" : '';
?>

<section
	class="block-name-section section <?php echo esc_attr( "section-display-{$display} {$spacing_top} {$spacing_bottom} {$custom_classes}" ); ?>"
	style="<?php echo esc_attr( "{$spacing_top_custom} {$spacing_bottom_custom} {$custom_css}" ); ?>"
	id="<?php echo esc_attr( $unique_id ); ?>"
	data-inview>

	<div class="container">
		<?php foreach ( $items as $item ) : ?>
			<!-- Item content -->
		<?php endforeach; ?>
	</div>

</section>
```

## Functions.php Structure

```php
<?php
/**
 * Load functions
 *
 * @package WordPress
 * @subpackage Skeleton
 * @since 1.0.0
 */

require get_template_directory() . '/functions/define-constants.php';
require get_template_directory() . '/functions/register-nav-menus.php';
require get_template_directory() . '/functions/helpers.php';
require get_template_directory() . '/functions/hooks.php';
require get_template_directory() . '/functions/enqueue-scripts.php';
require get_template_directory() . '/functions/register-acf-blocks.php';
// ... other function files

// Conditional includes
if ( 'local' === wp_get_environment_type() && current_user_can( 'manage_options' ) ) {
	require get_template_directory() . '/functions/debugging.php';
}

if ( 'production' === wp_get_environment_type() ) {
	require get_template_directory() . '/functions/security.php';
}
```

## Common Anti-Patterns

### ❌ Never Do This
```php
// Direct output without escaping
echo $variable;
echo $_GET['param'];

// Using short PHP tags
<? echo $var; ?>
<?=$var?>

// Hardcoded URLs
<link href="/wp-content/themes/skeleton/style.css">

// Direct database queries without preparation
$wpdb->query( "SELECT * FROM table WHERE id = " . $_GET['id'] );

// Not using text domain
__( 'Hello' )

// Wrong text domain
__( 'Hello', 'skeleton' )

// Trusting user input
$file = $_GET['file'];
include( $file );
```

### ✅ Do This Instead
```php
// Always escape output
echo esc_html( $variable );
echo esc_attr( sanitize_text_field( $_GET['param'] ) );

// Use full PHP tags
<?php echo esc_html( $var ); ?>

// Use WordPress functions for URLs
<link href="<?php echo esc_url( get_stylesheet_uri() ); ?>">

// Use prepared statements
$wpdb->prepare( "SELECT * FROM table WHERE id = %d", absint( $_GET['id'] ) );

// Always use text domain
__( 'Hello', 'skel' )

// Validate and sanitize
$allowed_files = [ 'header', 'footer', 'sidebar' ];
$file = sanitize_file_name( $_GET['file'] );
if ( in_array( $file, $allowed_files, true ) ) {
	include( get_template_directory() . '/parts/' . $file . '.php' );
}
```
